WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.800
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an action drama comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:18.800
called “Big Brother”. Watch out and take care!
Henry has returned to Hong Kong after serving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.880
in the US military for years. Looking to start a&nbsp;
career as a teacher, he goes to his former school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.920
Tak Chi secondary. The principal notes that&nbsp;
he doesn’t have experience in teaching. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:35.120
after being shown a recommendation letter from&nbsp;
a higher official, he is given the job. Before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.760
Henry leaves, the principal informs him that the&nbsp;
class he is assigned to teach is the worst one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:45.840
of their school. The morning of his first day at&nbsp;
school, Henry walks into the class to see that it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:51.920
is in absolute chaos. Some students are sleeping,&nbsp;
others are singing, some are playing video games,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:57.120
while a good number of them are cooking ramen on&nbsp;
a portable stove. Even after the teacher walks in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.520
they completely ignore him and continue what&nbsp;
they are doing. Henry tries to get their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.880
attention but they pretend to not hear him. 
He gives up trying to divert their attention and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:10.400
goes around the classroom commenting&nbsp;
on the things they are already doing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:15.040
The students who are cooking are asked to eat&nbsp;
less ramen because it contains too much sodium.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:20.560
Henry then approaches a guy named Zufa playing&nbsp;
ukulele and helps him with it. Similarly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.840
he warns a gamer kid against the radiation he&nbsp;
might receive from staring at the screen all day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.200
When the students finally start listening to&nbsp;
him, he introduces himself and writes his name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.160
and phone number on the board. The students&nbsp;
laugh because his handwriting is ugly. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:45.920
someone from the students calls him and asks him&nbsp;
to leave the class but Henry laughs it off. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:50.640
kids ignore him yet again and continue with the&nbsp;
activities they were doing before his arrival.
&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:56.080
Having enough of it, Henry uses a rubber&nbsp;
band and chalk to trigger the fire sprinkler&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.400
in the room. The students quickly spread&nbsp;
out to keep themselves from getting wet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:08.320
He finally gets their full attention and&nbsp;
officially welcomes them to his class.
&nbsp;

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:13.120
After class, a group of five lowest-ranking&nbsp;
students gathers in the sports supply room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.960
to smoke. The leader of the group Jack has a&nbsp;
crush on an A-grade student from another class.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:23.760
The others find him staring at her picture and&nbsp;
make fun of him. The group has a rivalry with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:28.480
the rich and spoiled kids from the school’s&nbsp;
basketball team. They enter the supply room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:34.720
and mock Jack as usual because he is poor. Later,&nbsp;
the basketball team is practicing while Jack and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.920
the group watch them from nearby. Jack drops a&nbsp;
bottle to the court which causes the team leader&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:45.600
to fall. The group laughs but is given detention&nbsp;
by the school's English teacher Miss Liang.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:50.880
To avoid detention, they play a prank on her and&nbsp;
run away when she is busy cleaning her desk. 
&nbsp;

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:55.920
Elsewhere, the school’s principal is distressed&nbsp;
because the education board is planning to deduct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:01.120
twenty percent of their annual funding. The people&nbsp;
from the board come to take a tour of the school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:04.560
to inspect where the funds are&nbsp;
being used. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.960
Henry enters the classroom where the students&nbsp;
have set up a bucket of water to prank him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:13.760
But his reflexes work faster than the falling&nbsp;
bucket and he is able to push it away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.000
The students who had been waiting to make&nbsp;
fun of him, are left shocked. Henry asks for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.720
Jack’s packet of cigarettes, knowing that&nbsp;
he smokes. Jack simply hands him the pack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:28.480
curious as to what he is about to do. Then, Henry&nbsp;
asks Zufa to name the three ingredients that are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:33.600
in a cigarette. When he answers the question&nbsp;
correctly, he is let to skip class for the day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:38.000
Everyone starts to bang on their desks demanding&nbsp;
that they should get to skip class as well.
&nbsp;

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.840
When they stop, he hands them all a cigarette and&nbsp;
asks them to analyze it. Henry knows that if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:49.840
simply mentions the effect it has on their health,&nbsp;
they won’t take it seriously. So instead, he asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:55.040
them about the outcomes of smoking cigarettes&nbsp;
and explains how tar forms in their lungs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.520
For the first time, they pay attention to the&nbsp;
teacher and are actually interested in learning.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:04.800
After the bell rings, he asks them to return the&nbsp;
cigarettes and the students reluctantly agree. 
&nbsp;

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:09.680
That day in the cafeteria, the captain of the&nbsp;
basketball team makes one of Jack’s friend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.640
Bruce trip on his leg. This gives rise to&nbsp;
an argument between the groups which soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:20.400
turns into a fight. They throw food and tables&nbsp;
at each other, destroying the place. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:25.520
Henry is informed that five students from&nbsp;
his class have been temporarily suspended&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:30.720
for starting the fight. Henry finds Jack fighting&nbsp;
his opponent in the hallway and stops them. 
&nbsp;

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:36.000
On being asked to calm down, Jack accuses the&nbsp;
school of being unfair because the rich kids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.600
get no punishment. That day after school, Henry&nbsp;
goes through the files of all five students to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:47.360
find out more about them. The first guy is named&nbsp;
Zufa, the son of a Pakistani immigrant who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:52.640
always discriminated against because of his race.&nbsp;
He is often accused of stealing by the policemen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:58.080
in his neighborhood. Zufa’s only wish in his life&nbsp;
is to become a musician. The second student is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:02.880
girl named Denan. She was a disappointment&nbsp;
to her father ever since her birth because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:08.240
he always wanted a son. Her entire life, Denan&nbsp;
has been trying to gain her father’s respect.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:13.520
She even cut her hair to a shorter length and&nbsp;
played with cars to pretend to be a boy. Yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:17.600
her father doesn’t care about her while he&nbsp;
treats her younger brother like a prince. 
&nbsp;

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:23.040
Then, there are brothers named Bruce and Chris.&nbsp;
Their mother ran away with a man when they were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:28.080
only kids which turned their father into an&nbsp;
alcoholic. The brothers only had each other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.040
to rely on while growing up. Bruce became&nbsp;
obsessed with video games to escape reality&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:36.960
while Chris worked hard in a grocery&nbsp;
store to make money for the family. 
&nbsp;

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:42.720
Lastly, Henry can find no information about&nbsp;
Jack’s family background. In the following scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:48.720
we see Jack working at a restaurant as a waiter.&nbsp;
An MMA bettor Jianying arrives at the restaurant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:53.920
with his business partners. When Jianying isn’t&nbsp;
looking, Jack steals his fancy lighter but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.920 --> 00:06:00.160
is caught. Jianying’s men beat him up as he checks&nbsp;
Jack’s ID. After finding out that he is a student,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:04.000
he gives him some money and offers him&nbsp;
a job as their food delivery man. 
&nbsp;

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.960
Somewhere else, Henry visits Zufa’s home and&nbsp;
finds him running away from his father and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:14.320
associates after stealing a ticket. He helps&nbsp;
him at first but after finding out why he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:19.280
being chased, he takes the father’s side.&nbsp;
Then, he and Zufa come to hang out at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:24.560
bridge. To motivate Zufa into doing whatever&nbsp;
he wants, Henry sings with a band performing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:30.080
in the streets. Seconds later, Zufa joins him&nbsp;
and sings in front of people for the first time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:35.040
after being bullied at school years ago. 
Meanwhile, Bruce and Chris’s father comes home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:40.320
late like always and orders them to bring him a&nbsp;
beer from the store. When the brothers refuse,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:46.000
he yells at them to get out of his house. The next&nbsp;
day, Henry meets with their father and convinces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.800
him to go to rehab for his sons’ wellbeing.&nbsp;
In the meantime, Denan’s father brings her a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:56.640
bag of makeup products and asks her to act like a&nbsp;
girl for once. Denan is furious at him for always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.200
making her feel like she is not good enough. She&nbsp;
applies the makeup on her younger brother and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:05.920
sneaks out of the house with the car key. She&nbsp;
is about to drive away in her father’s car but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:10.480
is stopped by Henry at the right moment. 
He tells her that driving without a license&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:16.400
is illegal and suggests an alternative. Following&nbsp;
that, they go to a Go-Kart race track. Henry also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:21.360
invites her father and makes them race. The father&nbsp;
and daughter show no mercy to each other during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:27.360
the race and eventually end up outside the track.&nbsp;
Suddenly, Denan’s go-kart is hit by a vehicle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:33.600
but she manages to dodge it. Unaware of this, her&nbsp;
father cries mourning his daughter's death. Denan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:39.280
realizes that he does in fact love her and hugs&nbsp;
him. The next day at school, Bruce and Chris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:44.640
along with a group, are sent to a rehabilitation&nbsp;
center to interview a recovering alcoholic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:49.280
They are surprised to see that the person they&nbsp;
have to interview is their father. The students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:54.640
ask him how he started to drink. The man answers&nbsp;
that he loved his wife dearly but she left him at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:59.760
the lowest point of his life. Hence, he started&nbsp;
to drink and forgot that he had two kids to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:04.960
care of. The man doesn’t reveal that Bruce and&nbsp;
Chris are his sons but apologizes to them. By&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.600
the end of it, the brothers are left crying.
Somewhere else, Jack has started to work for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:15.840
the MMA bettor Jianying. He offers Jack a lot of&nbsp;
money to drug a fighter’s drink in the next game.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:21.840
Jack is reluctant but is forced into accepting the&nbsp;
offer. On the day of the fight, Jianying sponsors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:27.840
a fighter but bets money on his loss. Jack puts&nbsp;
drugs on the fighter’s drink but is caught while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:33.280
doing so. Before he can blame Jianying, he&nbsp;
is beaten up and locked inside a locker.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:38.000
A while later, Henry arrives there and asks&nbsp;
the fighters if they have seen his student.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:43.440
The men ask him to return home but Jack, from&nbsp;
inside the locker, yells for help. After finding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:49.120
out he is being trapped, Henry attacks them and&nbsp;
overpowers them easily. When the fighters step it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:53.680
it gets a bit intense but Henry dodges&nbsp;
their attacks efficiently. By the end of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:57.680
he knocks out their best fighter who was&nbsp;
supposed to compete in a few minutes. 
&nbsp;

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:02.080
In the following scene, they are at the hospital&nbsp;
where Henry gets treated for his wounds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:07.440
Jack tries to reveal the truth about Jianying&nbsp;
but is made to shut up. The news makes it to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.920
the television and Henry starts being known&nbsp;
as the man who beat up a professional fighter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:17.200
to save his student. His popularity in school&nbsp;
grows and the students start to respect him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:22.560
They even get up to welcome him to the class, in&nbsp;
contrast to how they were earlier. A flashback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.280
shows us that Henry used to be a prankster when&nbsp;
he was in school. He even threw water balloons&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:33.200
at a student who was playing piano for the parents&nbsp;
in an event. Later, he fought the same student and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:38.560
broke his hand. He was suspended for the fight&nbsp;
after which he had to fly to the States. 
&nbsp;

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:43.360
Starting that day, the students pay attention&nbsp;
when Henry teaches in class and study hard for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:48.560
the upcoming college entrance test. Everyone is&nbsp;
doing great, except Bruce who has grown addicted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:53.360
to pills. It turns out that while Chris turned&nbsp;
to video games to avoid his family’s problem,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:58.240
Bruce started doing drugs. Because he is&nbsp;
unfocused, he does very badly in the mock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:04.480
entrance test. Henry promises to help him but&nbsp;
Bruce grows more depressed with time. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:09.920
he jumps off the balcony of their house. He is&nbsp;
rushed to the hospital and goes into a coma.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:14.880
The media twists the news and blames it on&nbsp;
the school and Henry for what Bruce did. 
&nbsp;

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:20.080
The officials from the education board interview&nbsp;
Henry and decide to revoke his teaching license.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:24.800
When he packs his things and leaves the school,&nbsp;
the students chase him behind, asking him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:29.200
stay. They are heartbroken by his absence but&nbsp;
they know that they should ace their upcoming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.480
test to make him proud. From that day, they&nbsp;
study twice as hard to prove to the board that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:40.240
Henry is a good teacher. On the day of the test,&nbsp;
Jack, along with all his classmates get a text&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:45.600
from Henry asking them to meet in the school an&nbsp;
hour before the exam. When the students gather,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:50.320
they find out that it was Jianying’s trick&nbsp;
to keep them confined in the school so they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:55.360
won’t make it to the examination hall in time.&nbsp;
He is doing this to teach Henry a lesson. 
&nbsp;

00:10:55.360 --> 00:11:00.960
A while later, Henry arrives at school and finds&nbsp;
out about Jianying’s plan. He lets the students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:05.600
free and fights all of Jianying’s people&nbsp;
to stop them from harming the children.
&nbsp;

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:10.800
They escape and quickly make their way to the&nbsp;
examination hall while Henry fights Jianying.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:15.200
While they are fighting one-on-one, Jianying&nbsp;
reveals that he was the guy who Henry had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:20.160
thrown water balloons at when he was little.&nbsp;
It turns out that since Henry broke his arm,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:24.480
he wasn’t able to compete in a big music&nbsp;
competition. Ever since the incident,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:30.080
he hasn’t touched a piano and blames Henry for&nbsp;
ruining his dream. Henry tries to reason with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:35.520
him but is attacked yet again. They struggle&nbsp;
to get a hold of a knife. At last, Henry gets a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:41.040
chase to kill him but doesn’t do it. He asks for&nbsp;
forgiveness for what he did when he was little&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:46.560
and walks away. The students reach the examination&nbsp;
hall at the right time and complete the test. 
&nbsp;

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:51.600
Cut to a few weeks later, they all pass with&nbsp;
flying colors. Jianying starts to play the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:56.560
piano again but has a lot to practice before he&nbsp;
gets as good as he used to be. Bruce recovers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:01.360
quickly and promises to attend the next year’s&nbsp;
entrance test. The principal is also delighted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:05.840
because the board decides to give them a twenty&nbsp;
percent bonus fund because their students did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:10.880
very well in the entrance test. Henry returns&nbsp;
to teaching and does the fire sprinkle trick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:14.720
on another batch of students. 
